        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electric installation, photovoltaic plant, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electric installation, photovoltaic plant, at plant
Production of different components of the electric installation of a 3kWp photovoltaic plant.;
UUID: 6e910062-f919-3dbe-b24f-96eee8f43df8
Materials and packaging for the production of cabling, lightning protection and fuse box. Inverter ist not included. Estimation for metal processing. Disposal of the product after use.
Location: Production in CH.
Technology: All electric installations for a photovoltaic system with a capacity of 3kWp. Including cables, counter, etc.
Time period: Date of data investigation.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Detailed analysis of materials for one product in a diploma thesis. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6e910062-f919-3dbe-b24f-96eee8f43df8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
